  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new Update coming Mutes won't be able to communicate as well with others as their avatars with markers/etc will be seen less often. I suggest adding a Marker that works like the camera as only that player can see it in their play space but it writes in world space. This would allow all users to have a marker on all avatars. It would free up gestures for animations. It'd create a way to optimize the markers so that people aren't cranking the settings up and create laggy markers. Players could also use the marker to write list, do presentations in every world, play tic tac toe, hangman, and other games. To fit it in the UI you could change the Camera button to Tools and start adding things like this as time goes on! Lastly the Marker should have 3 modes. Friends only, Public, Local. Mute streamers could talk to just their stream without populating the world. Friends would allow people to talk privately with just a friend. And Public everyone with it enabled can see. There should be an eraser tool a well so players can erase markers from their screen by choice. Toggle markers on/off etc.",
